Error [jet.FieldWriteWithoutMarker]: `.add()` changes `world`, which has read access only
  --> tests/ui/pool_read_only_param_mutation.jet:10:5
    |
 10 |     world.add(Player{name: "Kai", hp: 100})
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: `add: fn(&self, value: &&Player)` changes the value it's called on, but an unmarked parameter gives read access only
 Fix: Change the parameter to `world: &Pool<Player>`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0205

Error [jet.FieldWriteWithoutMarker]: `.remove()` changes `world`, which has read access only
  --> tests/ui/pool_read_only_param_mutation.jet:14:8
    |
 14 |     _: world.remove(id)
    |        ^^^^^
 Why: `remove: fn(&self, id: ID<Player>)` changes the value it's called on, but an unmarked parameter gives read access only
 Fix: Change the parameter to `world: &Pool<Player>`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0205
